== seven_types
plot · b against a

  axis   title   scale    limits         breaks
  x      a       linear   0.95 to 2.05   1, 1.2, 1.4, 1.6, 1.8, 2
  y      b       linear   0.65 to 8.35   2, 4, 6, 8

  aesthetic   title   scale      values                     shown as
  linetype    g       category   a, b, c, d, e and 2 more   solid, dashed, dotted, dash_dot, long_dash and 2 more

  layer   mark    data        marks   settings
      1   lines   the frame      14   width 1, linetype by g, 7 lines
---
note: `g` has 7 categories and there are 6 types of line, so the types repeat from the seventh category (line 2)

